[-] disregard		<-->	verb++[--0]	./ˌdɪsrɪˈɡɑːd/
 /ˌdɪsrɪˈɡɑːrd/\
(formal)
	;xem thường, xem nhẹ -- (1) disregard something to not consider something; to treat something as unimportant
